*** Add File: PRODUCT.md
+# Living garden
+
+Register: product. A playful browser ecology toy for curious people exploring cause and effect. The primary workflow is to choose a starting ecosystem, adjust energy and food rules, run time, and inspect creatures and population history. The physical scene is a small tabletop garden on a bright desk in afternoon sunlight. Personality: tactile, curious, gentle. Prioritize understandable behavior, real recorded data, keyboard-accessible controls, reduced-motion support, and responsive layouts. No fabricated population curves.
